  "description": "<p><strong>Yunthegane has allowed me to release his bundles in an updated mod.</strong></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Old Mod: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2289/the-better-reflex-sight-collection\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">The better reflex sight collection</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>BelOMO PK-06 included.</p>\n<h3>Original Description</h3>\n<p>Axion Kobra EKP-8-02|8-18</p>\n<p>Fast Fire</p>\n<p>EOTech HHS-1 hybrid sight/tan ver</p>\n<p>Pilad p1x42</p>\n<p>okp-7 (picatini straps)</p>\n<p>Walther MRS</p>\n<p>Aimpoint “Micro H-2”</p>\n<p>Valday Krechet reflex sight</p>\n<p>SIG Sauer ROMEO8T reflex sight</p>\n<p>ELCAN Specter HCO holographic sight</p>\n<p>All marks showcase - <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://imgur.com/a/XSH6dh2\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://imgur.com/a/XSH6dh2</a></p>\n<p>And of course, thank you Boogle for allowing me to use his mod “Old PK-06 Restoration” as the basis, without him this collection would not exist.</p>\n",
